WEBVTT

00:00:26.208 --> 00:00:30.708
MISSION 9
CRISIS ON THE ISLAND

00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:42.000
INDESTRUCTIBLE

00:01:51.333 --> 00:01:53.708
I told you to bring Seven back.

00:01:53.791 --> 00:01:56.125
Why did you save the security guard?

00:01:59.291 --> 00:02:03.083
Bastard! You wasted all your energy
saving him!

00:02:04.416 --> 00:02:07.375
Seven, hurry and run.

00:02:07.958 --> 00:02:10.750
Don't mess with those Stanians.

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:29.000
Did you block the missile?

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:46.083
Don't be fooled by their nerdy appearance.

00:02:47.583 --> 00:02:49.666
Why are you attacking the island?

00:02:51.625 --> 00:02:54.125
Were you the one who blocked the missile?

00:02:54.208 --> 00:02:57.375
FACIAL RECOGNITION

00:02:57.458 --> 00:02:59.041
SIMILARITY: 100%
CHIEF KILLER OF XUANWU

00:03:38.416 --> 00:03:40.083
PRINCE OF STAN
SPECIAL EQUIPMENT: COMBAT MACHINE

00:03:40.166 --> 00:03:41.500
Business first.

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:53.041
It's under this giant rock.

00:04:20.083 --> 00:04:24.708
Don't move that rock,
or the island will sink!

00:04:25.291 --> 00:04:28.500
Let me put on my pants first.

00:04:29.916 --> 00:04:30.833
Forget it.

00:04:36.916 --> 00:04:40.750
<i>Attention, everyone on the island.</i>
<i>I'm the Prince of Stan.</i>

00:04:41.291 --> 00:04:43.958
<i>There's a rare energy rock</i>
<i>underneath the island.</i>

00:04:44.041 --> 00:04:47.500
<i>I'm here to take it for our country's</i>
<i>technological development.</i>

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:50.125
<i>This island didn't exist before.</i>

00:04:50.208 --> 00:04:54.333
<i>The power of the energy rock attracted</i>
<i>materials and formed this island.</i>

00:04:54.916 --> 00:04:56.458
<i>After I take the energy rock,</i>

00:04:56.541 --> 00:04:58.458
<i>the island will fall apart and sink.</i>

00:04:58.958 --> 00:05:01.291
<i>Leave now if you don't want to die.</i>

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:10.458
Don't even think about it.

00:05:10.541 --> 00:05:13.250
You have no idea
how powerful the Stanians are.

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:16.000
It's time to tell you the truth.

00:05:16.083 --> 00:05:18.958
<i>This world consists of three great forces.</i>

00:05:19.041 --> 00:05:20.875
<i>Xuanwu with powerful kung fu,</i>

00:05:20.958 --> 00:05:22.958
<i>Stan with advanced technology,</i>

00:05:23.041 --> 00:05:26.000
<i>and us, the mediocre commoners.</i>

00:05:26.583 --> 00:05:30.166
<i>Although the Stanians look weak,</i>
<i>they are very intelligent.</i>

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:33.500
<i>They can invent all kinds of</i>
<i>high-end weapons,</i>

00:05:33.583 --> 00:05:35.458
<i>and believe technology</i>
<i>is the strongest weapon.</i>

00:05:35.541 --> 00:05:38.875
<i>They are the archenemy of Xuanwu,</i>
<i>a country who believes in martial arts.</i>

00:05:38.958 --> 00:05:41.000
<i>They have been at war for decades,</i>

00:05:41.583 --> 00:05:45.458
<i>just to prove which kung fu and technology</i>
<i>is the most powerful.</i>

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:48.875
<i>For us commoners, we can only</i>
<i>stand aside and watch.</i>

00:05:48.958 --> 00:05:51.083
<i>Our strength is far too weak</i>
<i>compared to those two countries.</i>

00:05:51.666 --> 00:05:55.333
You can't even kill Grannie.
You're just going to die if you go back.

00:06:01.125 --> 00:06:02.958
This is all I have.

00:06:03.541 --> 00:06:07.875
Can I hire you to kill these invaders?

00:06:08.458 --> 00:06:11.291
There's 3,243 RMB in my bank account.

00:06:12.208 --> 00:06:15.583
The password is 1-2-3-4-5-6.

00:06:18.041 --> 00:06:21.041
I'm in charge of half of the island.

00:06:21.125 --> 00:06:22.458
MEOW KITTY - CHIEF OF CATS
SKILL: CATERINE CLAW

00:06:22.541 --> 00:06:25.083
What you're doing is against the rules.

00:06:32.458 --> 00:06:35.125
It's time to trim your claws, Kitty.

00:06:48.875 --> 00:06:51.833
-Meow.
-Mad Bark.

00:06:58.041 --> 00:07:00.000
If anyone hurts my Meow,
I'll show him some real music!

00:07:00.083 --> 00:07:00.916
ROCK AND ROLL
MAD BARK

00:07:19.375 --> 00:07:20.208
It's just noise.

00:07:21.833 --> 00:07:24.625
OPPOSITE SOUND WAVES GENERATED

00:07:35.416 --> 00:07:39.541
Inferior creatures need to be tamed.
Little pets, call me your owner.

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:51.375
Go to hell, invader!

00:07:58.166 --> 00:08:00.583
UNCLE CHEN
CHICKEN ISLAND COAST GUARD

00:08:00.666 --> 00:08:01.791
BATTLE POWER: 45

00:08:06.208 --> 00:08:07.833
Bye, little pets.

00:08:09.291 --> 00:08:11.541
-Meow...
-Mad Bark...

00:08:11.625 --> 00:08:14.375
Hello, Four Eyes.

00:08:15.041 --> 00:08:17.166
Have you seen Seven?

00:08:17.250 --> 00:08:20.541
The one with three locks of hair
on his head.

00:08:21.791 --> 00:08:23.750
Come here. Let me share a secret with you.

00:08:23.833 --> 00:08:25.083
GIRL WITH SPECIAL POWERS
COLA SAFE

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:29.750
You know, on this island...

00:08:42.458 --> 00:08:44.916
whoever I kiss is my guy.

00:08:45.416 --> 00:08:48.041
Don't destroy this island. For me?

00:09:05.625 --> 00:09:07.750
Women are such a trouble.

00:09:09.708 --> 00:09:13.875
What you just said
is sexist and misogynistic.

00:09:14.416 --> 00:09:20.708
I am banishing you from the island
in the name of the Association of Purity.

00:09:30.625 --> 00:09:32.833
CHAIRMAN JIANG

00:09:33.416 --> 00:09:36.375
<i>How does this inferior human</i>
<i>have such a strong qi?</i>

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:06.166
Damn it!

00:10:12.166 --> 00:10:13.333
I'm really mad.

00:10:15.541 --> 00:10:16.708
Me, too.

00:10:17.916 --> 00:10:19.125
<i>As expected,</i>

00:10:19.208 --> 00:10:22.750
<i>it's still hard to take his power cannon</i>
<i>up front.</i>

00:10:28.416 --> 00:10:29.583
It's a tracking missile.

00:10:32.291 --> 00:10:34.416
Let's perish together, Four Eyes!

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:35.958
Highest-level Protection Shield.

00:10:37.625 --> 00:10:38.541
<i>Protection shield?</i>

00:10:39.708 --> 00:10:43.791
<i>I have failed to protect</i>
<i>the women on this island.</i>

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:06.208
SEVEN

00:11:16.166 --> 00:11:17.375
Chairman Jiang,

00:11:17.458 --> 00:11:20.541
don't play with such dangerous things
at your age.

00:11:20.625 --> 00:11:21.916
SEVEN - HAIR STYLIST
KILLER RANK: NO. 17,369

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:23.458
Let me handle this Four Eyes.

00:11:24.333 --> 00:11:26.291
I'll only charge you 88 RMB.

00:11:26.958 --> 00:11:29.000
All right, you take a nap here.

00:11:29.083 --> 00:11:31.833
Leave the rest to me.
